    comment: 'Transmit. The large send buffer matters here: the framemapper and cell
      interleaver work on WHOLE T2 frames, so the chain delivers 1,983,488 samples
      in a burst every 216.9 ms rather than a steady trickle. Without a reservoir
      the DAC runs dry in the gap and you get underflows even though the chain averages
      7.8x real time.'
